  Open outputs/nested_cv_verdict.csv first — it is the bottom line.
  Variable importance lives in two places and they answer different
  questions: clinical_predictor_table.csv (shuffle a column inside a model
  trained with it) and model_variable_ablation_osteopenia.csv (refit without
